pro_course_detail.description:
This course is for those who get started with learning English and for those who already know the basics.

You will learn how:
- to talk about yourself, your tastes, hobbies and nearest environment;
- to shop, to rent an apartment, to make an order in a restaurant;
- to express your opinion on different subjects in a simple way;
- to extract the most important information from authentic documents (websites, videos, songs, social media...);
- to read in English and to speak without (much of) accent.

You begin speaking from day one and we use as much English as possible (80-100% of the lesson).

Sure, the course can be tailored to your needs, whatever they are.

Don't hesitate to take a 30-minutes trial!

